# What docker/Dockerfile takes from the repository: the code, its scripts and release keys, and docker/pins.py.
# Nothing else reaches an image: no git history, environments, tests, the load generator or local builds.
**
!pyproject.toml
!LICENSE
!README.md
!src/
!scripts/
!release/
!docker/pins.py
src/verathos/throughput/verathos-loadgen
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
